---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { legacyArticles } from "../../data/site";
import "../../styles/article.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Writing"
  description="TonyScript 从 2017 年开始保留的技术、产品与个人写作档案。"
>
  <header class="page-intro">
    <div>
      <p class="identity-line">Writing / Public archive</p>
      <h1>旧内容保留，阅读体验向前。</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="lede">
      这里首先恢复 2017 年的十篇历史文章。原日期、标题和 URL 不变；未来内容将继续围绕 AI、产品、ITOM 与软件工程积累。
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="archive-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="archive-title">2017 archive</h2>
      <p>历史文章保留原始正文、图片、发布日期和 URL，并统一使用当前网站的阅读界面。</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/rss.xml">订阅 RSS →</a>
    </div>
    <ol class="index-list">
      {legacyArticles.map((article) => (
        <li class="index-item">
          <a class="index-link" href={article.href}>{article.title} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <p class="index-description">原发表于 {article.date}。</p>
          <time class="index-meta" datetime={article.date}>{article.category}</time>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="topics-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="topics-title">接下来写什么</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="tag-list">
      <li>AI</li><li>Product</li><li>ITOM</li><li>AIOps</li><li>Engineering</li><li>Career</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
